# <type>(<scope>): <short description in English, imperative, max 72 chars>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
# Scopes (optional): ui, editor, api, worker, transcriber, highlighter, reframer,
#                    render, captions, downloads, postpack, ai, scripts, deps
# Breaking change: add "!" after the type/scope and a "BREAKING CHANGE:" footer.
#
# Body (optional): explain WHAT changed and WHY, wrapped at 72 characters.
#
# Footer (optional): Closes #123 / BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
